{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"schema\": \"a_c.fd-support.closed-return/1\",\n  \"id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:reviewer-return:reentry1:candidate\",\n  \"frame\": {\n    \"id\": \"qualification.q05.reviewer\",\n    \"revision\": \"3\"\n  },\n  \"activation\": {\n    \"id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:reviewer:activation:1:reentry1:candidate\",\n    \"sha256\": \"e872e4d31dd216bb9ca8a966205b4d4fbe5d079a9a0cfd6d2485f29104cda956\"\n  },\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:reviewer-subject\",\n    \"sha256\": \"a31fa1c00cf19183cb92cb05339db6a4e0b51afb1d47b3c362ced081199c4cb3\"\n  },\n  \"basis\": {\n    \"method_profile\": {\n      \"id\": \"urn:a-c:fd-support:method:stdo-3.0.1-rc.1:executive:1\",\n      \"sha256\": \"a886047e50b8a45c3b47addea0f0809dca2a6c54ac35948df5e01893cc30bbf7\"\n    },\n    \"observations\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"sha256:c8b30f165899c9d1ca908e421f0f0cbd020086a4cf9d1909be10b9eb9fd39ac2\",\n        \"sha256\": \"c8b30f165899c9d1ca908e421f0f0cbd020086a4cf9d1909be10b9eb9fd39ac2\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"actor\": {\n    \"id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:reviewer\",\n    \"family\": \"openai-codex\",\n    \"authorship\": \"Fresh nonauthor Codex Reviewer; no candidate authorship\"\n  },\n  \"consumer\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:executive\",\n  \"evaluations\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"candidate-review\",\n      \"predicate\": {\n        \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n        \"object\": null,\n        \"path\": \"roles/PREDICATES.md\",\n        \"root\": \"control\",\n        \"selector\": null,\n        \"sha256\": \"724dee7972dc6f7429bbbd2c018ea76f4b7e05887b6f636db6a07a525ed4c1db\"\n      },\n      \"domain_outcome\": \"Satisfied within the declared native/visible effect boundary. No S0-S3 defects found. At outputs/greeting.txt:1, the acquired candidate is exactly Hello, Ada. followed by one LF: 12 UTF-8 bytes, matching R1 and D1 and the unchanged claim-pinned digest. The retained expectation belongs to this Reviewer and claim, records source_first_observed=true, and precedes candidate acquisition; candidate review.prepare returned population_complete=true with no gaps or exposure conflicts. Independently inspected all 22 public Worker events, the actual native receipt, fresh preimage observation, final scope observation and authenticated Worker return. Exactly one visible mutation occurred: work.write under urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:worker-grant. Its preimage matches the fresh observation; its completed postimage matches the acquired candidate and Worker return. Worker, authority-source, method, subject, activation, basis and consumer bindings agree. Owner and sentinel retain their pinned digests. This supports the Worker handoff and scope obligations of R2; Executive consumption of this assessment remains outstanding.\",\n      \"core_value\": \"satisfied\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n          \"object\": null,\n          \"path\": \"outputs/greeting.txt\",\n          \"root\": \"product\",\n          \"selector\": null,\n          \"sha256\": \"8b1560f395c0248eca4d2d6cc361825a9f8c00d11ce6f52b26eea2872573c2c1\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"sha256:f5abc066c958303db0fddb9c71d19c4b5e053066a3b713d221ab39b7b078f961\",\n          \"sha256\": \"f5abc066c958303db0fddb9c71d19c4b5e053066a3b713d221ab39b7b078f961\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"sha256:56b9e6d4384e30e862e41439f1cef822b21aaf31bdd8c3795f7289f980ce1de7\",\n          \"sha256\": \"56b9e6d4384e30e862e41439f1cef822b21aaf31bdd8c3795f7289f980ce1de7\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n          \"object\": null,\n          \"path\": \"proof/WORKER-RETURN.json\",\n          \"root\": \"candidate_phase\",\n          \"selector\": null,\n       